---
const image = "/assets/propertyflow/visuals/editorial/33-interior-evening.webp";
---

<section id="see-the-difference" class="page-section cf-demo" aria-labelledby="cf-demo-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="cf-demo__intro">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="i18n-en">Same business. A clearer first impression.</span><span class="i18n-pt">O mesmo negócio. Uma primeira impressão mais clara.</span></span>
        <h2 id="cf-demo-title"><span class="i18n-en">See what a focused fix can change.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Veja o que uma melhoria focada pode mudar.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p><span class="i18n-en">Switch between the two versions. Follow the message, the hierarchy and the next step.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Alterne entre as duas versões. Observe a mensagem, a hierarquia e o próximo passo.</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="cf-demo__workbench" data-conversion-demo>
      <div class="cf-demo__toolbar">
        <span class="cf-demo__sample"><span class="i18n-en">Illustrative example · fictional brand</span><span class="i18n-pt">Exemplo ilustrativo · marca fictícia</span></span>
        <div class="cf-demo__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Before and after / Antes e depois">
          <button id="cf-demo-before-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="cf-demo-before" tabindex="-1"><span class="i18n-en">Before</span><span class="i18n-pt">Antes</span></button>
          <button id="cf-demo-after-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="cf-demo-after" tabindex="0"><span class="i18n-en">After the fix</span><span class="i18n-pt">Após a melhoria</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cf-demo__browser">
        <div class="cf-demo__chrome" aria-hidden="true"><span>● ● ●</span><span>forma-studio.example</span><span>↗</span></div>
        <div id="cf-demo-before" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="cf-demo-before-tab" tabindex="0" hidden>
          <div class="cf-site cf-site--before">
            <div class="cf-site__nav"><span class="cf-site__brand">FORMA<span>INTERIORS</span></span><span><span class="i18n-en">Home · About · Services · More</span><span class="i18n-pt">Início · Sobre · Serviços · Mais</span></span></div>
            <div class="cf-site__hero">
              <div class="cf-site__copy">
                <span class="cf-site__kicker"><span class="i18n-en">Welcome to our website</span><span class="i18n-pt">Bem-vindo ao nosso site</span></span>
                <h3><span class="i18n-en">We make your dreams a reality.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Transformamos seus sonhos em realidade.</span></h3>
                <p><span class="i18n-en">Quality, innovation and excellence. Discover our complete range of solutions for your needs.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Qualidade, inovação e excelência. Conheça nossas soluções completas para suas necessidades.</span></p>
                <div class="cf-site__buttons"><span class="cf-site__cta"><span class="i18n-en">Learn more</span><span class="i18n-pt">Saiba mais</span></span><span class="cf-site__secondary"><span class="i18n-en">Our services</span><span class="i18n-pt">Nossos serviços</span></span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="cf-site__image"><img src={image} alt="" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="cf-site__strip"><span><span class="i18n-en">Quality</span><span class="i18n-pt">Qualidade</span></span><span><span class="i18n-en">Excellence</span><span class="i18n-pt">Excelência</span></span><span><span class="i18n-en">Innovation</span><span class="i18n-pt">Inovação</span></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="cf-demo__observations cf-demo__observations--before">
            <p><span>01</span><strong><span class="i18n-en">An offer you have to guess</span><span class="i18n-pt">Uma oferta que você precisa adivinhar</span></strong></p>
            <p><span>02</span><strong><span class="i18n-en">Two competing next steps</span><span class="i18n-pt">Dois próximos passos competindo</span></strong></p>
            <p><span>03</span><strong><span class="i18n-en">Claims without useful detail</span><span class="i18n-pt">Afirmações sem detalhes úteis</span></strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="cf-demo-after" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="cf-demo-after-tab" tabindex="0">
          <div class="cf-site cf-site--after">
            <div class="cf-site__nav"><span class="cf-site__brand">FORMA<span>INTERIORS</span></span><span><span class="i18n-en">Spaces for living.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Espaços para viver.</span></span></div>
            <div class="cf-site__hero">
              <div class="cf-site__copy">
                <span class="cf-site__kicker"><span class="i18n-en">Residential interior design</span><span class="i18n-pt">Design de interiores residenciais</span></span>
                <h3><span class="i18n-en">A home that feels like <em>you.</em></span><span class="i18n-pt">Uma casa que tem a sua <em>essência.</em></span></h3>
                <p><span class="i18n-en">Thoughtful interiors, from the first room concept to the final material. Start by telling us how you want to live.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Interiores pensados do primeiro conceito à escolha dos materiais. Comece contando como você quer viver.</span></p>
                <div class="cf-site__buttons"><span class="cf-site__cta"><span class="i18n-en">Tell us about your space</span><span class="i18n-pt">Conte sobre seu espaço</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div>
                <small class="cf-site__reassurance"><span class="i18n-en">A first conversation. Scope agreed before we begin.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Uma primeira conversa. Escopo alinhado antes do início.</span></small>
              </div>
              <div class="cf-site__image"><img src={image} alt="" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="cf-site__image-label"><span class="i18n-en">Room to feel at home.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Espaço para se sentir em casa.</span></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="cf-site__strip"><span><b>01</b><span class="i18n-en">Your space & routine</span><span class="i18n-pt">Seu espaço e sua rotina</span></span><span><b>02</b><span class="i18n-en">A considered concept</span><span class="i18n-pt">Um conceito pensado</span></span><span><b>03</b><span class="i18n-en">A plan to bring it to life</span><span class="i18n-pt">Um plano para concretizar</span></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="cf-demo__observations">
            <p><span>01</span><strong><span class="i18n-en">The service is clear at a glance</span><span class="i18n-pt">O serviço fica claro à primeira vista</span></strong></p>
            <p><span>02</span><strong><span class="i18n-en">One specific invitation to act</span><span class="i18n-pt">Um convite específico para agir</span></strong></p>
            <p><span>03</span><strong><span class="i18n-en">The visitor knows what follows</span><span class="i18n-pt">O visitante sabe o que vem depois</span></strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="cf-demo__note"><span class="i18n-en">A design demonstration, not a client result or a measured conversion uplift. The right changes for your site depend on its audience, goal and technical setup.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Demonstração de design, não um resultado de cliente ou aumento de conversão medido. As mudanças certas dependem do público, do objetivo e da estrutura técnica do seu site.</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const demo = document.querySelector('[data-conversion-demo]');
  if (demo) {
    const tabs = Array.from(demo.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[role="tab"]'));
    const select = (tab: HTMLButtonElement) => {
      for (const item of tabs) {
        const active = item === tab;
        item.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active));
        item.tabIndex = active ? 0 : -1;
        const panel = document.getElementById(item.getAttribute('aria-controls') || '');
        if (panel) panel.hidden = !active;
      }
    };
    tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {
      tab.addEventListener('click', () => select(tab));
      tab.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
        let target: HTMLButtonElement | undefined;
        if (event.key === 'ArrowRight') target = tabs[(index + 1) % tabs.length];
        if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft') target = tabs[(index + tabs.length - 1) % tabs.length];
        if (event.key === 'Home') target = tabs[0];
        if (event.key === 'End') target = tabs[tabs.length - 1];
        if (target) { event.preventDefault(); select(target); target.focus(); }
      });
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .cf-demo { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #090e18eb, #090b14e8); }
  .cf-demo__intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; align-items: end; gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .cf-demo__intro h2 { max-width: 760px; margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.4vw, 4.5rem); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .cf-demo__intro p { max-width: 420px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .cf-demo__workbench { overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #8bfaf036; border-radius: 24px; background: #0b121e; box-shadow: 0 28px 80px #0005; }
  .cf-demo__toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 18px 24px; }
  .cf-demo__sample { color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; }
  .cf-demo__tabs { display: flex; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 4px; padding: 4px; border: 1px solid #ffffff1f; border-radius: 50px; background: #030810; }
  .cf-demo__tabs button { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 22px; border: 0; border-radius: 50px; color: #bec8d7; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; font-size: .83rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .cf-demo__tabs [aria-selected="true"] { color: #062b28; background: var(--cyan); }
  .cf-demo__tabs button:focus-visible, [role="tabpanel"]:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 4px; }
  [role="tabpanel"][hidden] { display: none; }
  .cf-demo__browser { margin: 0 18px 18px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #ffffff26; border-radius: 12px; }
  .cf-demo__chrome { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 20px; color: #a8b5c6; background: #151d2b; font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .cf-demo__chrome > span:first-child { color: #6c798d; letter-spacing: .25em; }
  .cf-site { color: #242e29; background: #edece5; }
  .cf-site__nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; min-height: 82px; padding: 20px 5%; border-bottom: 1px solid #293d2726; font-size: .72rem; }
  .cf-site__brand { display: grid; color: #253f32; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: .11em; }
  .cf-site__brand > span { margin-top: 5px; font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .47rem; letter-spacing: .3em; }
  .cf-site__hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; min-height: 395px; }
  .cf-site__copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: start; padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 50px); }
  .cf-site__kicker { color: #4d624e; font-size: .64rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .cf-site h3 { margin: 18px 0; color: #273e30; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.9vw, 3.8rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.03; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .cf-site h3 em { color: #6a7448; font-weight: 400; }
  .cf-site__copy > p { max-width: 360px; margin: 0; color: #566258; font-size: .82rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .cf-site__buttons { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }
  .cf-site__cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 26px; padding: 13px 20px; border-radius: 3px; color: #fbf8ed; background: #294a37; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .cf-site__secondary { color: #4c5850; font-size: .75rem; }
  .cf-site__reassurance { display: block; margin-top: 12px; color: #5b685d; font-size: .62rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .cf-site__image { position: relative; min-height: 280px; overflow: hidden; }
  .cf-site__image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .cf-site__image-label { position: absolute; right: 20px; bottom: 18px; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #fff5; color: #fff; background: #17251fb3; font-size: .65rem; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
  .cf-site__strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; padding: 20px 5%; border-top: 1px solid #293d2726; font-size: .69rem; }
  .cf-site__strip > span { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
  .cf-site__strip b { color: #718461; font-size: .6rem; }
  .cf-site--before { background: #dddeda; }
  .cf-site--before .cf-site__copy { align-items: center; text-align: center; }
  .cf-site--before h3 { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.8rem); line-height: 1.2; color: #5b625d; }
  .cf-site--before .cf-site__cta { color: #4d554e; border: 1px solid #a4ada3; background: #d6dbd2; }
  .cf-site--before .cf-site__image img { filter: saturate(.5); }
  .cf-site--before .cf-site__strip { color: #667066; text-align: center; }
  .cf-site--before .cf-site__strip > span { justify-content: center; }
  .cf-demo__observations { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; padding: 24px; background: #111e27; }
  .cf-demo__observations p { display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 12px; margin: 0; }
  .cf-demo__observations p > span { color: var(--cyan); font-size: .66rem; }
  .cf-demo__observations strong { color: #e0e9ee; font-size: .77rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.6; }
  .cf-demo__observations--before { background: #221e22; }
  .cf-demo__observations--before p > span { color: #e4c79e; }
  .cf-demo__note { max-width: 800px; margin: 18px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .73rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .cf-demo__intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }
    .cf-demo__toolbar { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; padding: 18px; gap: 12px; }
    .cf-demo__tabs { align-self: start; }
    .cf-demo__browser { margin: 0 10px 10px; }
    .cf-site__hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cf-site__copy { min-height: 345px; }
    .cf-site__image { height: 250px; min-height: 0; }
    .cf-site h3 { font-size: 2.7rem; }
    .cf-demo__observations { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 20px; }
    .cf-site__nav { padding: 18px 22px; }
    .cf-site__nav > span:last-child { max-width: 140px; text-align: right; font-size: .6rem; }
    .cf-site__strip { gap: 10px; padding: 18px; font-size: .6rem; }
    .cf-site__strip > span { flex-direction: column; align-items: start; }
  }
</style>
